  "q0AnchorReason": "fingerprints grouped-era |tr_M| at BOTH documented pins (proton Q_50_DIGIT_STR and the live CODATA-2022 muon pin q_muon_at(70)) so a grouped value is matched whichever pin produced it; both pins are read on purpose"
